#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid ""
"Due to a technical issue on our platform, your order %(order_number)s with seller %(vendor_name)s "
"cannot be processed. The order has been cancelled at no cost to you, and we have immediately "
"issued a full refund of EUR %(refund)s to your original payment method (credited within 5–10 "
"business days, and in any event within the statutory 14-day limit). We apologize for the "
"inconvenience."
msgstr ""
"Te informamos de que, debido a un error técnico de la plataforma, no es posible tramitar tu pedido"
" n.º %(order_number)s con el vendedor %(vendor_name)s. El pedido ha sido cancelado sin coste "
"alguno para ti y hemos ordenado de inmediato el reembolso íntegro de EUR %(refund)s en el mismo "
"medio de pago utilizado (abono en 5 a 10 días laborables y, en todo caso, en un máximo de 14 "
"días). Te pedimos disculpas por las molestias."

